WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,060
I touched a box

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,060
One star resource box

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,060
There are two pieces of meat

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,060
Trash upstairs

5
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,060
I even touched the two-star resource box

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,060
Where are the twenty units of wood?

7
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
Forget about the box

8
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
I've been looking for it all day

9
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,060
Not even a hair was found

10
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,060
Is there really a box?

11
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,060
What happened to my font

12
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,060
Why are you bleeding?

13
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:22,060
When your font starts to bleed

14
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,690
Prove your place

15
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,690
It has been discovered by hunters within a radius of twenty miles

16
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:29,690
Try your best to survive

17
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,690
Will this happen again, brother?

18
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:36,780
Your fate is not good

19
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,040
But then again

20
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,040
What exactly is a hunter?

21
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,040
How strong is it

22
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,040
That's fatal, man.

23
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,040
Seek blessings from yourself
